    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Help, we have a major crisis. One of our refrigerated containers for a shipment of fresh tuna just lost power mid-transit. The temp readings jumped from -18C to 4C in under an hour. I need a checklist of immediate steps to handle the immediate spoilage risk and what I need to do regarding safety protocols for the remaining stock.",
