      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Activate your company's emergency response plan immediately and isolate the compromised container to prevent cross-contamination of the remaining cargo. Prioritize rapid quality assessment of the tuna; if bacterial growth is significant, the entire batch must be discarded and replaced to comply with food safety regulations. While waiting for official inspection results, secure the damaged unit separately and notify relevant food safety authorities to document the incident for regulatory review.",
