    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "we checked the cables and the power source everything looks totally fine. it's just these weird, intermittent logic errors popping up every few minutes and then vanishing. it's almost like something is actively interfering with the signal or causing tiny, unexplained glitches in the circuitry. is there any other technical reason for such \"spontaneous\" malfunctions in a sealed unit?",
